@page "/"

<PageTitle>One Big Team | Simple HR Software for Growing Teams</PageTitle>
<HeadContent>
    <meta name="description" content="One Big Team helps small and medium-sized businesses manage employees, leave, sickness, documents, recruitment and compliance from one simple platform.">
</HeadContent>

<SiteHeader CurrentPage="home" />

<main id="home">
  <section class="hero section-band">
    <div class="section-inner hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">HR, recruitment and workforce admin in one place</p>
        <h1>Simple HR software for growing teams</h1>
        <p class="hero-text">
          One Big Team helps small and medium-sized businesses manage employees,
          leave, sickness, documents, recruitment and compliance from one simple platform.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions" id="trial">
          <a class="button button-primary button-large" href="/contact#contact-form">Start free trial</a>
          <a class="button button-secondary button-large" href="/contact#contact-form">Contact us</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="One Big Team product dashboard preview">
        <img src="/assets/one-big-team-hero.png" alt="Mockup of the One Big Team HR dashboard showing employee records, leave, recruitment and reporting panels.">
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section problem">
    <div class="section-inner two-column">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">The growing-team problem</p>
        <h2>People operations get messy before they look broken.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="copy-block">
        <p>
          Growing businesses often start with spreadsheets, email trails and disconnected
          systems to manage people processes. It works for a while, then leave requests,
          sickness notes, recruitment updates and compliance tasks begin to scatter across
          inboxes, shared drives and individual memory.
        </p>
        <p>
          One Big Team gives teams a shared HR workspace so everyday workforce admin is
          easier to find, easier to manage and easier to keep consistent.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="features" class="section section-muted">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Feature overview</p>
        <h2>Everything your HR team needs to stay organised.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-grid">
        <article class="feature-card">
          <span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
          <h3>Employee records</h3>
          <p>Keep employee details, roles and key documents in one dependable place.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature-card">
          <span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
          <h3>Leave management</h3>
          <p>Give teams a clear way to request, review and track time away from work.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature-card">
          <span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
          <h3>Sickness tracking</h3>
          <p>Record absences consistently and spot patterns without digging through email.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature-card">
          <span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
          <h3>Recruitment</h3>
          <p>Track candidates, hiring stages and role progress from first contact to offer.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature-card">
          <span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">05</span>
          <h3>Company documents</h3>
          <p>Store policies, templates and shared files where employees can find them.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature-card">
          <span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">06</span>
          <h3>Workflows and reminders</h3>
          <p>Turn repeat HR tasks into reliable prompts, approvals and follow-ups.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature-card">
          <span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">07</span>
          <h3>Reporting</h3>
          <p>Understand headcount, leave, sickness and recruitment activity at a glance.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
        <h2>Set up your HR workspace in four clear steps.</h2>
      </div>

      <ol class="steps">
        <li>
          <span>1</span>
          <h3>Create your company</h3>
          <p>Start with your business profile and the basics your HR system needs.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span>2</span>
          <h3>Import your organisation</h3>
          <p>Add active employees so pricing and team structure can be confirmed.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span>3</span>
          <h3>Configure your HR settings</h3>
          <p>Set leave rules, document areas, workflows and reminder preferences.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span>4</span>
          <h3>Invite your team</h3>
          <p>Bring managers and employees into a workspace built for everyday use.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="pricing" class="section pricing-teaser">
    <div class="section-inner pricing-panel">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p>
        <h2>Simple pricing based on active employee count.</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>
          One Big Team pricing is based on the number of active employees in your
          organisation. Your exact monthly price is confirmed after organisation import,
          so the plan reflects the team you actually manage.
        </p>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="/pricing">Discuss pricing</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="about" class="section section-muted">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Why teams choose One Big Team</p>
        <h2>Built for SMBs that need clarity without extra complexity.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="benefit-grid">
        <div>
          <strong>One source of truth</strong>
          <p>Bring records, requests, documents and reminders into one shared workspace.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>Less manual chasing</strong>
          <p>Give managers clearer workflows and employees a simpler route to support.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>Ready for growth</strong>
          <p>Keep HR consistent as your team expands, restructures or hires more often.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="section final-cta">
    <div class="section-inner cta-panel">
      <p class="eyebrow">Start building your HR foundation</p>
      <h2>Bring your people processes together with One Big Team.</h2>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary button-large" href="/contact#contact-form">Start free trial</a>
        <a class="button button-secondary button-large" href="/contact#contact-form">Contact us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<SiteFooter />
